without hacking the code.

Start up a wizmode game, levelport to each of the levels (to create dungeon 
layout and initial monsters), return to level 1, and save. Open the savefile 
and play.

Only problem is that it's a wizmode game already. You'd have to play as 
though wizmode weren't operational. Might be an interesting exercise among a 
few friends who'd play by the honor system. Unuseable in a tournament 
setting. 

